74-649)**  \nWhile these specific frame ranges are not included in this 30-frame set, the provided frames (586–615) are consistent with the “afternoon on the first day” visit. The visual evidence is sufficient to evaluate the state of the park during this visit.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**  \nThe amusement park depicted in these frames is visibly **not well maintained** compared to typical modern amusement parks. The presence of rust, peeling paint, overgrown vegetation, and dilapidated structures strongly supports the answer **‘0’ (Not well maintained)**.\n\n✅ **Answer: 0 (Correct)**'}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0616.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0617.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0618.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0619.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0620.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0621.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0622.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0623.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0624.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0625.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0626.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0627.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0628.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0629.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0630.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0631.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/frame_0632.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/_T2Avd3tFHc/frames/fra